0125094521\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Dignity intact.\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/c/c0/Dignity_intact..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20210125094521\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/c/c0/Dignity_intact..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20210125094521 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/c/c0/Dignity_intact..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/536?cb=20210125094521 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Dignity intact.\" width=\"270\" height=\"152\" data-image-key=\"Dignity_intact..png\" data-image-name=\"Dignity intact..png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"series\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Series</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Series_5\" title=\"Series 5\">5</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"episode\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Episode</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">1</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"winner\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Winner</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bob_Mortimer\" title=\"Bob Mortimer\">Bob Mortimer</a></div>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Episode Guide</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\">← Previous</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\">Next →</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\"><a href=\"/wiki/Tony_Three_Pies.\" title=\"Tony Three Pies.\">Tony Three Pies.</a></td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_leprechaun_or_the_lesbian.\" title=\"The leprechaun or the lesbian.\">The leprechaun or the lesbian.</a></td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><i><b>Dignity intact.</b></i> is the first episode of <a href=\"/wiki/Series_5\" title=\"Series 5\">Series 5</a> of <i><a href=\"/wiki/Taskmaster\" title=\"Taskmaster\">Taskmaster</a></i> and was first broadcast on <a href=\"/wiki/Dave\" title=\"Dave\">Dave</a> on 13 September 2017. The episode was won by <a href=\"/wiki/Bob_Mortimer\" title=\"Bob Mortimer\">Bob Mortimer</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Episode_title\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode title</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Alternate_titles\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Alternate titles</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Episode_breakdown\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode breakdown</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#External_links\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">External links</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_title\">Episode title</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode title\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Dignity_intact.?veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode title\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>\"Dignity intact\" is something that <a href=\"/wiki/Aisling_Bea\" title=\"Aisling Bea\">Aisling Bea</a> uttered, while stood on a dock in her underpants, at the end of the <a href=\"/wiki/Get_Alex_onto_dry_land_as_elegantly_as_possible\" title=\"Get Alex onto dry land as elegantly as possible\">Get Alex onto dry land as elegantly as possible</a> task. The coconut in the title card is not a reference to any specific task, rather the entire series. <a href=\"/wiki/Series_5\" title=\"Series 5\">Series 5</a> featured numerous tasks involving coconuts and the title card is reflecting that.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Alternate_titles\">Alternate titles</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Dignity_intact.?veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li>On Denmark's TV2 Play streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Værdigheden bevaret', which translates as 'Dignity preserved'.</li>\n<li>On Finland's MTV Katsomo streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Arvokkuus tallella', which translates as 'Dignity intact'.<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_breakdown\">Episode breakdown</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Dignity_intact.?veaction=edit&amp;section=3\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mbox\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;wrapper\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;header\">Spoilers!</div><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;text mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-spoilers\">This section contains spoilers.</div><span class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;close mw-customtoggle-spoilers\" title=\"Dismiss\"></span></div></div></div>\n<table class=\"tmtable\">\n\n<tbody><tr class=\"tmtableheader\">\n<th>Task\n</th>\n<th>Description\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Aisling_Bea\" title=\"Aisling Bea\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Aisling Bea</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Bob_Mortimer\" title=\"Bob Mortimer\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Bob Mortimer</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Mark_Watson\" title=\"Mark Watson\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Mark Watson</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Nish_Kumar\" title=\"Nish Kumar\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Nish Kumar</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Sally_Phillips\" title=\"Sally Phillips\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Sally Phillips</span></a>\n</th></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Something_that_makes_the_most_excellent_noise\" title=\"Something that makes the most excellent noise\">1</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Prize:</b> Something that makes the most excellent noise.\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Give_Alex_a_special_cuddle\" title=\"Give Alex a special cuddle\">2</a>\n</td>\n<td>Give Alex a special cuddle.\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Get_Alex_onto_dry_land_as_elegantly_as_possible\" title=\"Get Alex onto dry land as elegantly as possible\">3</a>\n</td>\n<td>Get Alex onto dry land as elegantly as possible. Alex must remain dry.\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Get_the_basketball_through_the_hoop\" title=\"Get the basketball through the hoop\">4</a>\n</td>\n<td>Get the basketball through the hoop. You may not touch the basketball with your hands. You may not wear gloves or anything that could reasonably be construed to be gloves.\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>DQ\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Get_one_item_of_fruit_into_the_fishbowl\" title=\"Get one item of fruit into the fishbowl\">5</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Live:</b> Get one item of fruit into the fishbowl. You may not leave or move your chair. You may not throw your fruit.\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtabletotal\">\n<th colspan=\"2\">Total\n</th>\n<td>13\n</td>\n<td class=\"tmtablewinner\">18\n</td>\n<td>17\n</td>\n<td>13\n</td>\n<td>14\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video\">Video</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Video\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Dignity_intact.?veaction=edit&amp;section=4\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Video\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><small><i>Video unavailable in some regions. Find an alternative service <a href=\"/wiki/Watch_Taskmaster\" title=\"Watch Taskmaster\">here</a>.</i></small>\n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\" typeof=\"mw:File\"> <a href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/File:Taskmaster_-_Series_5,_Episode_1_-_Full_Episode_-_%27Dignity_Intact%27\" class=\"video video-thumbnail medium \"> \t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/0/05/Taskmaster_-_Series_5%2C_Episode_1_-_Full_Episode_-_%27Dignity_Intact%27/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/350?cb=20210130003911\" alt=\"Taskmaster_-_Series_5,_Episode_1_-_Full_Episode_-_&#39;Dignity_Intact&#39;\" height=\"263\" width=\"350\" data-video-key=\"Taskmaster_-_Series_5,_Episode_1_-_Full_Episode_-_&#39;Dignity_Intact&#39;\" data-video-name=\"Taskmaster - Series 5, Episode 1 - Full Episode - &#39;Dignity Intact&#39;\" class=\"\" /> \t<span class=\"thumbnail-play-icon-container\"> \t\t<svg class=\"thumbnail-play-icon wds-icon\" aria-label=\"Play\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-player-icon-play\"></use></svg>\t</span> </a> <figcaption></figcaption></figure><div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_links\">External links</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Exter